fe because it offered people a political home larger than tribe or nation. Empire, in his design, was not domination; it was a structure of belonging and order capable of unifying different worlds into a single horizon.", "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2", "voice_settings": {"stability": 0.55, "similarity_boost": 0.85, "style": 0.15, "use_speaker_boost": true}}' \
